41cbc5931e9f383e303a4c75c47b2045.mp4?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle demons in a six-element card duel!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll six elemental die to determine the cards you can play! To keep or to reroll... The choice is yours! Just make sure Manari doesn't get hurt. Her clothes tear easily...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/3310136958afc27e4d132b013bec5a12.poster.avif?t=1752802194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/3310136958afc27e4d132b013bec5a12.webm?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/3310136958afc27e4d132b013bec5a12.mp4?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get assistance from your helpful senpai!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the battle gets tough, you can always count on the money-grubbing Yutaka to lend a hand! She also sells talismans and ninjitsu to help enhance your deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/4587450c0f9989f74e9b90375d805a7f.poster.avif?t=1752802194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/4587450c0f9989f74e9b90375d805a7f.webm?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/4587450c0f9989f74e9b90375d805a7f.mp4?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your ninja skills!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Sacred Jewels after each battle and use them to boost Manari's ninja level. Each level grants permanent upgrades that will definitely come in handy during battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/81e3e967d038b977a9ce76ae077e4fb4.poster.avif?t=1752802194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/81e3e967d038b977a9ce76ae077e4fb4.webm?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/81e3e967d038b977a9ce76ae077e4fb4.mp4?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manari's future is in your hands!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world filled with demons and tragedy, do you have what it takes to lead Manari to her happy ending? Immerse yourself in this epic drama with full  voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/eb5e841d9a1e66acbdab13391797cd57.poster.avif?t=1752802194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/eb5e841d9a1e66acbdab13391797cd57.webm?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/eb5e841d9a1e66acbdab13391797cd57.mp4?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn and view H-scenes without losing a single battle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 20 animated H-scenes, over 200 different CG variations, and almost every naughty act and position you can think of! There will also be plenty of cute feet, even in the non-footjob scenes, if you're into that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/f0260683d31ccea203c441cf0a6e948f.poster.avif?t=1752802194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/f0260683d31ccea203c441cf0a6e948f.webm?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/f0260683d31ccea203c441cf0a6e948f.mp4?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More importantly, if you're not a fan of intentionally losing to collect all H-scenes, Agu can also transform into a demon, allowing you to enjoy the same scene as the pair try awkwardly to adjust to this development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/0ffac06f31b50ebb0b75feb377a57f91.poster.avif?t=1752802194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/0ffac06f31b50ebb0b75feb377a57f91.webm?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460070/extras/0ffac06f31b50ebb0b75feb377a57f91.mp4?t=1752802194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
